tion": "\"Last Chance: The Survivor\" is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRealistic VR Experience:\nHigh-quality graphics and fluid VR mechanics for an immersive post-apocalyptic experience. Interact naturally with a world full of interactive objects and realistic physics.\n\nStrategic Combat:\nDiverse weapons for varied strategies. Defeat enemies using environmental tactics and smart resource management.\n\nDiverse Zombies:\nFace different types of zombies, each requiring unique combat approaches. From swift attackers to more formidable foes, adapt your strategy to survive.\n\nHighscore Mode:\nEndless action in Highscore Mode. Aim for high scores against increasing zombie waves. Tests shooting skills, quick thinking, and agility.\n\nVersions: \n1.0.3 - Our game is still in EARLY ACCESS. 'Highscore' and 'Training' modes are currently playable. New modes coming soon! Thanks for your feedback and support! ", "short_description": "Last Chance: The Survivor is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lastchancevr.com/privacypolicy